/Count -4 /Dest [ 57 0 R /Fit ] /First 101 0 R /Last 104 0 R /Parent 97 0 R /Prev 99 0 R 
  /Title (Q10 Explain the concept of consumer and producer surplus. \(10\)Ans Consumer surplus and producer surplus are measures of the economic welfare, or benefit, that buyers and sellers gain from participating in a market. They are best understood together, using a demand and supply diagram, because each is a triangular area measured from the equilibrium price.)
>>
